-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SCOPE

The MIT licence above covers EVERYTHING in this repository that is ours: the
code in `nocot/`, the documentation, `models.csv`, and the bank items in
`data/` — the generated NCRI banks, the generated knowledge banks, the harder
rungs in `data/extras/` and the diagnostic instruments in `data/diagnostics/`.

Two things in `data/` are not ours to relicense, and the MIT grant above does
not purport to cover their upstream rights:

  * `data/ncri/cemc.jsonl` and `data/ncri/cemc_hard.jsonl` reproduce University
    of Waterloo CEMC contest items (published freely by the CEMC; each item
    carries its `source_url`).
  * `data/ncri/o_gsm1k.jsonl` reproduces the public GSM1k test split, with
    GSM8K-train exemplars (MIT).
  * `data/ncri/gpqa.jsonl` is NOT distributed here at all. It is rebuilt from
    the gated upstream by `python -m nocot.fetch_gpqa`, under whatever terms you
    accepted there (CC BY 4.0 at the time of writing).

`data/PROVENANCE.md` names each bank's source. Everything else is MIT.
